"This chunk covers 13 files, 3,405 manifest-counted lines, 143,159 bytes, "
"and 32,097 measured tokens. All six bounded pages were read through their"
" listed ranges. This is static inspection only; I did not import or "
"execute the application, modify `src/`, run tests, or independently "
"verify legal rules or registry content."
msgstr ""
"Este bloque abarca 13 archivos, 3,405 líneas contadas en el manifiesto, "
"143,159 bytes y 32,097 tokens medidos. Se leyeron las seis páginas "
